  <description>Derived copy of https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/House%203 version 3 (Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/); original model directory /home/konstantinos/.local/share/aerial-qrl/fuel_cache/fuel.gazebosim.org/openrobotics/models/house%203/3. Defect: House 3 v3 ships only an Ogre1 material script (House_3/Diffuse); it rendered black in the first flood-sar-village/1 renders (output/mission/village_v1/renders_all_victims). Change: derived copy as house_1_pbr: same mesh for visual and collision (absolute file://, scale 1.5), PBR metal material with the original House_3_Diffuse.png albedo (the model ships no normal map); original files untouched.</description>
</model>
